# Pairs with RestoreReturns, under the fairness Spec asserts. A retry treats
# the reservation its own failed attempt still holds as another operation's,
# and waits for it to be released - which only the retry would do.
MODULE: RestoreReturnsRetryNeedsFreeReservation
TARGET: RestoreReturns
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a retry waits for a reservation that its own failed attempt holds
PERTURBS: Retry

--- FIND
    /\ rp = "failed"
    /\ rp' = IF alias = "shadow" THEN "swapped" ELSE "built"
--- REPLACE
    /\ rp = "failed"
    \* MUTATION: the retry needs a free reservation.
    /\ ~reserved
    /\ rp' = IF alias = "shadow" THEN "swapped" ELSE "built"
--- END
